# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the gestures: held and let go, latched, kept; the pressure ones
# (v0.3) pressed all the way in and let go. Rendered by this branch and by main;
# a change that keeps the sound gives the same samples. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
