pressure w1 0
pressure w2 0
pressure w3 0
pressure w4 0
pressure w5 0
pressure w6 0
pressure w7 0
pressure w8 0
pressure w9 0
pressure w10 0
pressure w11 0
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
wav gesture-weight.wav
wait 1000
key w12 down
wait 4000
key w12 up
wait 6000
wavstop
